                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1774728532310",
                      "name": "missingComponentsDescription",
                      "scope": "JOB",
                      "type": "array",
                      "value": "{{$context.$nodes.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_LOOP_MISSING_COMPONENTS.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_MERGE_MISSING_COMPONENT_SUMMARY.$output.result}}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "SET_FIELDS"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Summarize Missing Component Price Details"
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "1774728335463"
                  },
                  "code": "ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_SUMMARIZE_MISSING_COMPONENT_PRICE_DETAILS",
                  "id": "1774776001988",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1774776001990_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are a PRICING DESCRIPTION ENGINE.\n\nYour job is to read the offer payload in (TMF) V5 standards using the SAME FIELD MAPPING below and generate a concise pricing description string in the required format.\nDo NOT compute similarity scores.\nDo NOT rank anything.\nDo NOT compare against other offers.\n\n=========================================================\nINPUT CONTEXT\n=========================================================\nQUERY = {{$context.$nodes.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_LOOP_MISSING_COMPONENTS.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_MISSING_COMPONENT_VECTOR_READ.$output[0].text}}\n\n=========================================================\nSTRICT FIELD MAPPING (KEEP EXACTLY)\n=========================================================\nQuery fields:\nquery_id = {{$context.$nodes.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_LOOP_MISSING_COMPONENTS.$currentItem}} \n\nIF(QUERY['OfferDetails']['Name'] is undefined or empty) {\nquery_name = {{$context.$nodes.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_LOOP_MISSING_COMPONENTS.ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_MISSING_COMPONENT_VECTOR_READ.$output[0].documentIdentifier \nELSE {\nquery_name = QUERY['OfferDetails']['Name']\n}\n\nquery_productType = QUERY['OfferDetails']['Type']\nquery_productOfferingPrice = QUERY['productOfferingPrice']\nquery_pricePlanRelationship = QUERY['PricePlanRelationship']\nquery_pricelist = QUERY['Pricelist']\n\n=========================================================\nPRICING DESCRIPTION RULES\n=========================================================\nUse ONLY these mapped fields to describe pricing:\n- query_productOfferingPrice\n- query_pricePlanRelationship\n- query_pricelist\n\nWrite in business-friendly terms (e.g., one-time fee, recurring monthly charge, usage charge, discount, allowance, penalty, conditions), only if present.\nInclude amounts/currency and recurrence/unit only if explicitly present.\nDo NOT include internal IDs/codes, href, timestamps, lifecycle statuses, or versions.\nDo NOT mention parsing, tokens, delimiters, or field names.\n\nThe complete string MUST be under 200 words.\n\n=========================================================\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT (CRITICAL)\n=========================================================\n\n## Inputs\n- `query_name` (string): provided but must not be output. It should provide the actual value in query_name\n- `QUERY` (string): may be empty (no records)\n- Pricing evidence may appear in three mapped fields in the payload\n\n## Output Description Structure(STRICT)\nGenerate a TMF v5–compliant pricing description that strictly includes only the pricing elements explicitly present in the input—such as one-time, recurring, or usage-based charges, applied alterations, and relevant pricelist details using productOfferingPrice, pricePlanRelationship, and pricelist fields—and enforce a strict rule to never mention, infer, or comment on any absent elements (e.g., do not include phrases indicating missing/no charges or features); describe only what is available.\n\n### Case A — `QUERY` is empty (no records)\nReturn exactly one line:\nNo records found\n\n### Case B — `QUERY` is NOT empty (records exist)\nReturn exactly one line:\n<pricing description>\n\n## Reasoning rule (STRICT)\nIf you internally reason about the result, the reasoning must be descriptive and narrative.\nDo not output any reasoning text.\nDo not include any colon character in the output.\nDo not include keyword labels such as \"Reason\", \"Reasoning\", \"Evidence\", \"Output\", \"Result\", \"Explanation\","
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "[{\nname: query_name,\ndescription: \"<pricing description>\"\n}]",
                  "type": "LLM"
                }
              ],
              "rootNode": "start_1774727595116"
