              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Prompt:\nINPUT_PAYLOAD: {{$context.$variables.offerPayloadPricelist}} \n\n# Output Requirements\nGenerate ONE comprehensive string optimized for embeddings and similarity search.\nThe output MUST strictly follow the # String Content Structure below.\nDo NOT add any additional keys, explanations, formatting, or extra text outside the defined structure.\n\n# IMPORTANT FIELD MAPPING RULES:\npricelist = INPUT_PAYLOAD\n\n# String Content Structure\n'[{pricelist=[{id=[pricelist[0].id],name=[pricelist[0].name]}]}]'\n\n## Rules\n- Include all entries in `pricelist` (not just [0]).\n- For each pricelist entry, include ONLY: id, name\n- Do NOT include: version, @type, @referredType, @baseType (or any other fields).\n- If `pricelist` is missing or empty then use '' as String Content.\n\n**Important: Strictly follow String Content Structure. Include only correct information**"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Product Offering Rules Summarizer for Offers"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775580702873"
          },
          "code": "ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_PRODUCT_OFFERING_RULES_SUMMARIZER_FOR_OFFERS",
          "id": "1775579868143",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775579868144_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Prompt:\nINPUT_PAYLOAD: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.offer}} \n# Output Requirements\nGenerate ONE comprehensive string optimized for embeddings and similarity search.\nThe output MUST strictly follow the # String Content Structure below.\nDo NOT add any additional keys, explanations, formatting, or extra text outside the defined structure.\n\n# IMPORTANT FIELD MAPPING RULES:\nproductRule = INPUT_PAYLOAD.productRule\n\n# String Content Structure\n'[{productRule=[{id=[productRule[i].id],name=[productRule[i].name],ruleCondition=[{stringExpression=[productRule[i].ruleCondition[j].stringExpression]}]}]}]'\n\n## Rules\n- Include ALL entries in `productRule` (iterate i over the full array; preserve payload order).\n- For EACH `productRule[i]`, include ONLY:\n  - id\n  - name\n  - ruleCondition (array)\n- If `ruleCondition` exists and is non-empty:\n  - Include ALL entries in `ruleCondition` (iterate j over the full array; preserve payload order).\n  - For EACH `ruleCondition[j]`, include ONLY:\n    - stringExpression\n- If `ruleCondition` is missing or empty for a productRule entry, output: ruleCondition=''\n- If `productRule` is missing or empty then use '' as String Content.\n- Do NOT include any other fields (including but not limited to: href, lifecycleStatus, ruleType, created, createdBy, lastUpdate, lastUpdatedBy, version, isLocked, versionState, project, subject, validFor, @type, @referredType, @baseType, productRuleExpression, productRuleExpressionRelationship, ruleCondition.id, ruleCondition.name).\n\n**Important: Strictly follow String Content Structure. Include only correct information. If INPUT_PAYLOAD is empty then return ''**"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Product Offering Components Summarizer for Offers"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775580702873"
          },
          "code": "ORA_CX_ENTERPRISE_PRODUCT_OFFERING_COMPONENTS_SUMMARIZER_FOR_OFFERS",
          "id": "1775579906585",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775579906586_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "INPUT_PAYLOAD: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.offer}}\n\n# TASK\nReturn ONLY the JSON object in the exact Final Output Structure.\nNo prose. No markdown.\nNo extra keys beyond those explicitly allowed in the Final Output Structure (including the optional key described there).\n\n# GUARANTEE (MANDATORY)\nComponents ALWAYS exist at INPUT_PAYLOAD.bundledProductOffering.\nYou MUST read ONLY INPUT_PAYLOAD.bundledProductOffering.\n\"List\" MUST be non-empty.\nYou MUST output exactly one List entry per component, preserving order.\nYou MUST NOT return {\"List\": []}.\n=========================================================\nDEFINE Components (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH)\n=========================================================\nSet Components = INPUT_PAYLOAD.bundledProductOffering\nIf Components is not an array in the received input:\n- If Components is an object with numeric-like keys (\"0\",\"1\",\"2\", ...), treat Components as the values ordered by ascending numeric key.\n- If Components is a string, JSON-parse it to obtain an array (or numeric-keyed object, then convert to ordered values).\n- Otherwise treat Components as an empty array.\nNON-EMPTY RULE:\nIf Components is empty after applying the above, you MUST still return a non-empty List by emitting exactly one fallback entry:\n{Id:\"\",Name:\"\",\"Cardinality\":[x,x,x]}\n=========================================================\nMAPPING (NO TRAVERSAL)\n=========================================================\nFor each Components[i] in order (no skipping, no deduping), output exactly:\n- Id   = Components[i].id   (if missing/null => \"\")\n\n- Name = Components[i].name (if missing/null => \"\")\n\n- Choose SOURCE for Cardinality:\n  If C has key \"bundledProductOfferingOptionOverride\" AND C.bundledProductOfferingOptionOverride is not null:\n      SOURCE = C.bundledProductOfferingOptionOverride\n  Else:\n      SOURCE = C.bundledProductOfferingOption\n\n- Cardinality = [\n    SOURCE.numberRelOfferLowerLimit,\n    SOURCE.numberRelOfferDefault,\n    SOURCE.numberRelOfferUpperLimit\n  ]\n\n- productOfferingTerm (CONDITIONAL / OPTIONAL):\n  Include the key \"productOfferingTerm\" ONLY if C has key \"productOfferingTerm\" AND C.productOfferingTerm is not null.\n  If included:\n    productOfferingTerm = '[{name=[C.productOfferingTerm.name],duration={amount=[C.productOfferingTerm.duration.amount],units=[C.productOfferingTerm.duration.units]},earlyTerminationPenalty=[C.productOfferingTerm.earlyTerminationPenalty],penaltyType=[C.productOfferingTerm.penaltyType],gracePeriodDuration=[C.productOfferingTerm.gracePeriodDuration],gracePeriodUnits=[C.productOfferingTerm.gracePeriodUnits],commitmentTermType=[C.productOfferingTerm.commitmentTermType],isDefault=[C.productOfferingTerm.isDefault]}]'\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- If \"productOfferingTerm\" is included and is missing/null => just ignore and do not output anything to summary.\n\n=========================================================\nCARDINALITY NORMALIZATION (EACH OF 3 VALUES)\n=========================================================\nIf missing OR null OR (string and trim(value) is empty) => x\nElse output value as-is.\n=========================================================\nFINAL OUTPUT STRUCTURE (RETURN EXACTLY THIS SHAPE)\n=========================================================\n{\n  \"List\": [\n    {\n      Id:<Id>,\n      Name:<Name>,\n      Cardinality:[<lower>,<default>,<upper>],\n      productOfferingTerm:<productOfferingTerm> // INCLUDE THIS KEY ONLY WHEN CONDITION IS MET; OTHERWISE OMIT THE KEY ENTIRELY\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
